<Positioned left="698.00" top="836.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· mamma 乳状云（云底垂悬半球）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="698.00" top="862.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· virga 幡状云（纤维状下垂）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="698.00" top="888.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#B9C4CE" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">—</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="698.00" top="914.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#B9C4CE" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">—</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1048" width="960" height="150"><Container width="960" height="150" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E3DAC6"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1048" width="6" height="150"><Container width="6" height="150" color="#6E93B4" borderRadius="3"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1064.00" width="500.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="15" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">观测提示（只引来源结论）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1096.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 最常见的中云；常多个层次在不同高度同时出现</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1124.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 云块视宽 1–5°：大于小指（Cc ＜1°）、小于三指（Sc ＞5°）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1152.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 与层积云判别 30° 规则：云块多在地平线上 30° 以上且 ＞5° → 层积云</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="560.00" top="1096.00" width="440.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 薄处常见华（corona，外红内蓝）与彩云（irisation）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="560.00" top="1124.00" width="440.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 有时下垂纤维状幡状云（virga）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="560.00" top="1152.00" width="440.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 有时看似纤维状或正在消散；远看云块可似合并</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1218" width="470" height="86"><Container width="470" height="86" color="#6E93B41A" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #6E93B455"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="80.00" top="1230.00" width="200.00" height="20.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#C75B39" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">拉丁词根</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="80.00" top="1252.00" width="430.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="16" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">alto- + cumulus = 中层 + 堆积</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="80.00" top="1280.00" width="430.00" height="18.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="10.5" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">alto 原意为「高」，此处表「中层」（与低层的积云相别）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="550" top="1218" width="470" height="86"><Container width="470" height="86" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="14" border="1 SOLID #E3DAC6"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="570.00" top="1230.00" width="200.00" height="20.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#C75B39" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">30 秒判别</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="570.00" top="1252.00" width="440.00" height="44.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12.5" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">云底 2–6 km + 云块 1–5°、有阴影 → 高积云；＜1° 无阴影 → 卷积云；＞5° 且高于 30° → 层积云</Text></Container></Positioned>
